<title>USA: U.S. Gulf rigs under contract up 1 at 163.</title>
<headline>U.S. Gulf rigs under contract up 1 at 163.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were 163 rigs under contract in the U.S. Gulf as of December 13, up one from the prior week, Offshore Data Services said.</p>
<p>The utilization rate for rigs working in the Gulf, based on a total fleet of 178, was 91.1 percent.</p>
<p>The number of working rigs in European/Mediterranean remained the same this week at 105 rigs under contract out of a total fleet of 105, a utilization rate of 100 percent.</p>
<p>The worldwide rig count rose one to 561 out of a total fleet of 604, making the utilization rate 92.9 percent.</p>
<p>--New York Energy Desk 212-859-1620</p>
</text>
